%% Contract Management lifecycle flow
%% Shows progression from draft through execution and renewal decisions.
flowchart LR
    Draft[Draft Authoring]
    Review[Review and Negotiation]
    Approve[Approval]
    Execute[Execution]
    Track[Obligation Tracking]
    Decision[Renew/Amend/Terminate Decision]

    Draft --> Review --> Approve --> Execute --> Track --> Decision
    Review -->|Revision| Draft
    Decision -->|Amend| Draft
